caption: Youth
setting-component: youth

Each valid sacrifice reverses the hunter’s biological age by 12 months, to a minimum biological age of 25. Once the hunter is biologically 25, additional years are banked as future unaging.

One qualifying kill per year therefore allows a hunter to remain effectively the same biological age. Two kills per year allow a hunter to grow approximately one year younger per year until age 25, after which the excess benefit becomes banked unaging.
